      }
    },
    "This plan follows the exam's usual structure while we finish reading its official documents. If they change your plan, you'll decide on Today." : {
      "comment" : "Under a plan revealed before its exam's official documents were read",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Plan folgt dem üblichen Aufbau der Prüfung, während wir die offiziellen Unterlagen fertig lesen. Falls sie deinen Plan ändern, entscheidest du heute darüber."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este plan sigue la estructura habitual del examen mientras terminamos de leer sus documentos oficiales. Si estos hacen que cambie el plan, decidirás qué hacer en Hoy."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
